fTPUGZqPIWUUDYq2BdGe3PxOf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-18\",\"runtime\":76},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Episode 2\",\"overview\":\"The members tackle Seoraksan's brutal 10-hour course. Pork belly and ramyeon at the shelter taste like heaven — but the real hell begins on the descent.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2DJCrncJzx38O0YX5ab96gqmuVU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-18\",\"runtime\":74},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Episode 3\",\"overview\":\"They head up Taebaeksan on a tempting offer that could make future hikes easier — but the steep trail leaves Car, the garden with pain in his leg.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u2ZOEX3uwosyNzuHBhMqTWttOKU.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-18\",\"runtime\":66},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Episode 4\",\"overview\":\"The four race the clock to reach the summit before sunrise. During a Korean beef feast after the hike, they learn that the next peak awaits in Jeju.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cVMJiqA4unS1I5HhCgoZUWKwBiv.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-18\",\"runtime\":62},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Episode 5\",\"overview\":\"After soaking up Jeju's charms, the group splits up for their next climb — only to find one team's path smooth and the other's far tougher than expected.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kqiV9aPHXO6gP5F5At5C35Escwf.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-18\",\"runtime\":63},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Episode 6\",\"overview\":\"After brutal climbs and burning lungs, they reunite at the legendary Baengnokdam. For a brief moment, the stunning view makes them forget the pain.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oTCBwqaKNen8kmsAIyv8LaqUAo5.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-25\",\"runtime\":79},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Episode 7\",\"overview\":\"The club heads to Ulsan, Tarzzan's hometown. Later, a surprise during the break turns out to be exactly what they'd wished for: a game with Nah Yung-suk.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qGEOJu33VneTHdCUuiMBd7bulDC.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-25\",\"runtime\":57},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Episode 8\",\"overview\":\"The Yeongnam Alps hike gets off to a rocky start, but a sea of golden reeds keeps them going — and even makes Car, the garden pull out his phone.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3ZMhcgYo9QghDBuxk8YfzuQ22CK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-08-25\",\"runtime\":86},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Episode 9\",\"overview\":\"After stopping by Tarzzan's place, they dive into a final showdown with Producer Nah. Play it right and they might just flip the whole show on its head!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q5LRUgWpVv03STNVjhfYRI5B8Jq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-01\",\"runtime\":61},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Episode 10\",\"overview\":\"The four take on their final mission — hiking the nation's \\\"sacred\\\" mountain — and wonder if they finally get why on earth people go to the mountains.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dj8v8J92n7Xq7DXmm5EaTiY1FwR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2026-09-01\",\"runtime\":80}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2026-08-18\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}